# Normalise everything to LF in the repository *and* on checkout.
#
# This is not hygiene, it is a bug fix. A shell script whose first line is
# "#!/bin/sh\r" fails with "/usr/bin/opshare-sync: not found" - the kernel
# looks for an interpreter literally named "sh\r" - and procd then restarts it
# forever. That happens whenever the tree is edited on Windows without this
# file, so the CRLF->LF conversion is pinned here as well as at pack time
# (build-ipk.py normalises again, so a bad checkout still cannot ship breakage).
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.ipk binary
